          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Connect</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"An intimate series of aromatherapy gatherings and offerings. Safety-forward, poetry-infused practice.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#0f1720;\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\\n      --muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);\\n      --accent-start:#8ee7d7;\\n      --accent-mid:#7dc6ff;\\n      --accent-end:#c7a7ff;\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      --max-width:980px;\\n      --soft-shadow: 0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n      color-scheme: dark;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);}\\n    /* layered SVG pattern sits beneath content */\\n    body::before{\\n      content:\\\"\\\";\\n      position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;\\n      background-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 20%, rgba(155,200,190,0.06) 0 8%, transparent 18%), linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(120,40,200,0.04), rgba(20,160,200,0.02));\\n      mix-blend-mode: screen;\\n      pointer-events:none;\\n    }\\n    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;opacity:0.14;}\\n    main{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:var(--max-width);margin:48px auto;padding:36px;}\\n    header.site{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:22px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-start),var(--accent-mid),var(--accent-end));box-shadow:var(--soft-shadow);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#082;}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.2px}\\n    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}\\n    nav.site-nav{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:13px}\\n    nav a.current, nav a:hover{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.04),transparent);color:#fff}\\n\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:var(--soft-shadow);backdrop-filter: blur(6px);}\\n\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:24px}\\n    .hero-main h2{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05;color:#fff}\\n    .hero-main p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted);}\\n    .hero-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .contact-card .muted{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .btn-primary{display:inline-block;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-mid),var(--accent-end));color:#072;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}\\n\\n    .section{margin:26px 0}\\n    .section h3{margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:16px;color:#fff}\\n    .section p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}\\n\\n    .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px}\\n    .list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n\\n    .schedule-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}\\n    .schedule-table th, .schedule-table td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,0.03);text-align:left;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    .price-grid{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .price-card{flex:1 1 200px;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.01), rgba(255,255,255,0.02));}\\n    .price-card h4{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#fff}\\n    .faq dt{font-weight:600;color:#fff;margin-top:12px}\\n    .faq dd{margin:6px 0 0 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    form.contact-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}\\n    form input, form textarea, form select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);outline:none}\\n    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    form .row input{flex:1}\\n    .footnote{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    footer{margin:32px 0 80px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      .hero, .two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .hero-side{order:2}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <!-- layered decorative SVG pattern (unique) -->\\n  <div class=\\\"pattern-wrap\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <svg width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 600\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#7ee9d8\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.14\\\" />\\n          <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#caa7ff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.08\\\" />\\n        </linearGradient>\\n        <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"130\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n          <rect width=\\\"80\\\" height=\\\"130\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"14\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.6\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n          <circle cx=\\\"48\\\" cy=\\\"86\\\" r=\\\"2.6\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.05\\\" />\\n          <path d=\\\"M0 120 Q40 80 80 120\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"#fff\\\" stroke-opacity=\\\"0.02\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\" />\\n        </pattern>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" />\\n      <g transform=\\\"translate(40,30) rotate(-6)\\\" opacity=\\\"0.18\\\">\\n        <ellipse cx=\\\"420\\\" cy=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"320\\\" ry=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"#9ee7d8\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <header class=\\\"site\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">A</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav class=\\\"site-nav\\\" aria-label=\\\"Primary\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Market</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Rates</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Gather</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" class=\\\"current\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero card hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-main\\\">\\n        <h2>Whisper your intent. We will craft the atmosphere.</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">A seasonal series of small gatherings and private rituals led by {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} — safe, sensory, and gently guided. Share a time, ask a question, or simply arrive. We listen through scent.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"height:16px\\\"></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <span class=\\\"footnote\\\">Or call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></span>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"hero-side card contact-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Visit / Inquiries</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"height:8px\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"height:10px\\\"></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <svg width=\\\"36\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" aria-hidden>\\n            <path d=\\\"M12 2c5.523 0 10 4.477 10 10s-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12 6.477 2 12 2z\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"></path>\\n            <path d=\\\"M12 7a5 5 0 100 10 5 5 0 000-10z\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\"></path>\\n          </svg>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;color:#fff\\\">Connect</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"ritual-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"ritual-title\\\">A miniature ritual</h3>\\n      <p>Every gathering opens with a brief centering: breath, intention, and a gentle introduction to the oils we will use. We focus on sensory awareness — notes, texture, atmosphere — rather than promises. All blends are shared with dilution guidance and clear labeling.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section two-col\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"expect-title\\\">What to expect</h3>\\n        <p id=\\\"expect-desc\\\">Expect small groups (6–12), guided scent exploration, a brief DIY blending moment, and time to sit with the aroma. Sessions move slowly. No medical advice is offered; aromatherapy is presented as supportive sensory practice and not a substitute for healthcare.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"height:16px\\\"></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"list\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Safety-first</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">Dilution suggestions and patch testing are part of every session. Tell us about allergies, pregnancy, or pets in advance.</p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Bring</strong>\\n            <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">Comfortable clothing and an open curiosity. We provide materials.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <h3>Quick contact</h3>\\n        <form class=\\\"contact-form\\\" onsubmit=\\\"return handleSubmit(event)\\\" novalidate>\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <input name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Your name\\\" />\\n            <input name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"Phone\\\" aria-label=\\\"Phone number\\\" />\\n          </div>\\n          <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" required aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\" />\\n          <select name=\\\"interest\\\" aria-label=\\\"Interest\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"series\\\">Attend a series</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"private\\\">Private ritual</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"blend\\\">Blend consult</option>\\n          </select>\\n          <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"A short note — allergies, pet concerns, preferred days...\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\"></textarea>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn-primary\\\">Send</button>\\n            <div class=\\\"footnote\\\">We reply within 3 business days.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"footnote\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">By sending you agree to receive scheduling emails. We do not share your information.</div>\\n        </form>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"schedule-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"schedule-title\\\">Upcoming sessions</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">An ongoing series runs monthly. Slots are limited; pre-booking recommended.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n      <table class=\\\"schedule-table\\\" aria-describedby=\\\"schedule-note\\\">\\n        <thead>\\n          <tr><th>Date</th><th>Theme</th><th>Location</th></tr>\\n        </thead>\\n        <tbody>\\n          <tr><td>Mar 6, 2026 — Sat</td><td>Quiet Citrus — uplifting, lucid notes</td><td>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</td></tr>\\n          <tr><td>Apr 10, 2026 — Fri</td><td>Soft Timber — grounding blends</td><td>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</td></tr>\\n          <tr><td>May 8, 2026 — Sat</td><td>Moonlight Herb — cool herbal facets</td><td>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</td></tr>\\n        </tbody>\\n      </table>\\n      <p id=\\\"schedule-note\\\" class=\\\"footnote\\\">Exact times and small-group addresses provided after booking.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"pricing-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"pricing-title\\\">Contributions</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">Sliding scale and transparent packages. Prices include materials and a small take-home sample. No refunds for missed sessions; transfers possible depending on availability.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"height:10px\\\"></div>\\n      <div class=\\\"price-grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n          <h4>Intro Evening</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"footnote\\\">$35 — 90 minutes, group</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n          <h4>Workshop Series</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"footnote\\\">$120 — 4 sessions, materials included</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"price-card\\\">\\n          <h4>Private Ritual</h4>\\n          <div class=\\\"footnote\\\">From $95 — bespoke session for one or two</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"faq-title\\\">Questions we often hear</h3>\\n      <dl class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n        <dt>How should I dilute essential oils?</dt>\\n        <dd>We present standard dilution ranges during sessions. For topical use we typically suggest low dilutions (1–3%) for adults; we include written guidance and pre-diluted samples. Always follow the provided instructions.</dd>\\n\\n        <dt>Should I patch test?</dt>\\n        <dd>Yes. A small patch test is recommended for topical use. We encourage testing on inner forearm and waiting at least 24 hours to check for sensitivity.</dd>\\n\\n        <dt>Are scents safe for pets?</dt>\\n        <dd>Some essential oils can affect pets. If you share your home with animals, tell us in advance so we can recommend pet-safe options and avoid scheduling home-based diffusions without consent.</dd>\\n\\n        <dt>What about pregnancy?</dt>\\n        <dd>Pregnancy requires extra caution. Some oils are not recommended. Please disclose pregnancy when booking; we will adapt blends and offer pregnancy-safe alternatives. We do not provide medical advice.</dd>\\n      </dl>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"section card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"cta-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"cta-title\\\">Reserve a place</h3>\\n      <p>Seats are small to keep the space calm. If you prefer, request a private consult or ask about corporate/wellness bookings.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n      <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      <div style=\\\"height:12px\\\"></div>\\n      <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">Prefer to speak? <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p>Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} • Favorite blend on hand: {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}</p>\\n      <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">All aromatherapy content is intended for sensory and wellbeing support. No medical claims are made.</p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    function handleSubmit(e){\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      const form = e.target;\\n      const name = form.name.value.trim();\\n      const email = form.email.value.trim();\\n      if(!name || !email){\\n        alert('Please include your name and email.');\\n        return false;\\n      }\\n      // simulate send\\n      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. We received your request and will reply soon.');\\n      form.reset();\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"This bundle contains two files for the aromatherapy site (chunk 4): contact.html and README.md.\\n\\nPurpose\\n- contact.html: A complete, self-contained contact + events page in the aura_editorial layout with a minimal_poetic voice and an events_series offer model. It includes the required sections: hero, ritual, what_to_expect, schedule, pricing, faq, cta.\\n- README.md: This file.\\n\\nPlaceholders\\n- Replace the placeholders where appropriate: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}.\\n\\nNotes & guidance\\n- Visuals: the page uses only CSS and an embedded SVG pattern. There are no external images, fonts, or CDNs.\\n- Accessibility: basic ARIA labels and semantic headings are included. Forms perform minimal front-end validation.\\n- Safety: content is intentionally safety-forward. No medical claims are made. FAQ covers dilution, patch testing, pets, and pregnancy.\\n- Assets: the page references an inline SVG pattern. A complementary file is expected at assets/img/pattern.svg (create a unique SVG there for project consistency if not already present).\\n\\nSeed & metadata\\n- Seed: 944590453\\n- Slug: aromatherapy-2026-02-16T16-25-57-747Z-018\\n\\nCustomization\\n- To change the color accents, edit the CSS variables near the top of contact.html.\\n- To adjust schedule or pricing, edit the corresponding table and price cards in the HTML.\\n\\nFiles included\\n- contact.html — contact + events page\\n- README.md — this file\\n\\nIf you need the complementary pages (index, services, blends, shop, pricing, about, book) or the SVG asset (assets/img/pattern.svg), request the next chunk and they will be provided.\\n\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
